{"product":{"id":8631073603838,"title":"SiS Hydro Tablets","body_html":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eScience In Sport GO Hydro Tablets\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePure-electrolyte \u003cstrong\u003ehydro tablets\u003c\/strong\u003e built for athletes, gym-goers, and active adults who need fast hydration without the carbohydrate calories of a sports drink. Ideal for hot training sessions, gym workouts, daily hydration in heat, recovery after long runs or rides, and anyone training in Sri Lanka's climate where sweat losses are higher than most product packaging assumes — making genuine sodium replacement essential.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat makes GO Hydro worth choosing over a basic flavoured water or generic salt tab comes down to specific concentration and pedigree. Each tablet drops into 500ml of water to deliver 30mmol\/L of sodium plus magnesium and a vitamin blend, with virtually no calories. That 30mmol\/L sodium level is the key detail: it's the research-backed concentration that maximises fluid retention and absorption — most generic electrolyte tablets significantly under-dose sodium, which is exactly the electrolyte you actually need to replace post-exercise. The product was originally developed for the British Sailing team at the 2008 Beijing Olympics, where heat acclimatisation and hydration protocols were critical to medal-level performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eFor anyone asking what are electrolyte tablets used for, the practical answer is restoring sodium and minerals lost through sweat to maintain hydration status, prevent cramping, and support recovery — without the carb load of a full sports drink. Science In Sport is a UK-based brand publicly listed on the London Stock Exchange (AIM: SIS) and manufactured to \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/health-topics\/good-manufacturing-practices\"\u003eGMP\u003c\/a\u003e standards. GO Hydro is \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/sport.wetestyoutrust.com\/\"\u003eInformed-Sport\u003c\/a\u003e registered with batch-level testing for WADA-banned substances, making it a credible choice for tested-pool athletes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e30mmol\/L sodium per 500ml serving\u003c\/strong\u003e — research-backed concentration for genuine hydration, not a token salt dose\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlus magnesium and added vitamins\u003c\/strong\u003e — broader electrolyte support beyond just sodium\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOnly 9 calories per serving\u003c\/strong\u003e — a clean alternative to carb-heavy sports drinks for daily and gym use, ideal \u003cstrong\u003ehydro pills\u003c\/strong\u003e for hot-climate training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e20 tablets per tube\u003c\/strong\u003e, vegan, gluten-free, lactose-free, nut-free, soya-free — covers most allergen profiles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOriginally developed for the British Olympic Sailing team\u003c\/strong\u003e — a serious answer for \u003cstrong\u003ehydro tablet uses\u003c\/strong\u003e including training, recovery, and travel rehydration\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePair it with an isotonic energy drink mix or carb snacks from our \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"\/collections\/energy-hydration\"\u003eenergy and hydration range\u003c\/a\u003e to round out a complete training and hydration plan.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"SCIENCE IN SPORT","product_type":"ELECTROLYTES","created_at":"2024-08-22T19:22:34+05:30","handle":"sis-go-hydro-tablets","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:25:48+05:30","published_at":"2026-04-02T10:46:33+05:30","template_suffix":"science-in-sport","published_scope":"global","tags":"ELECTROLYTES, HYDRATION, INFORMED SPORTS, RECOVERY, VITAMINS \u0026 MINERALS","variants":[{"id":45846740926718,"product_id":8631073603838,"title":"1 Tube (